{"overview":"در تابستان سال اول دبیرستان، هوداکا از جزیرهٔ دوردست خود به توکیو می‌گریزد و به سرعت به مرزهای مالی و شخصی خود می‌رسد. هوا هر روز به‌طور غیرعادی ابری و بارانی است، گویی از زندگی او الهام گرفته است. پس از روزهای تنهایی، او شغل نویسندهٔ آزاد برای یک مجلهٔ عرفانی مرموز پیدا می‌کند. سپس روزی در گوشه‌ای شلوغ شهر، هوداکا با هینا ملاقات می‌کند؛ دختری روشن‌فکر و سرسخت که توانایی عجیبی دارد: متوقف کردن باران و پاک کردن آسمان.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The summer of his high school freshman year, Hodaka runs away from his remote island home to Tokyo, and quickly finds himself pushed to his financial and personal limits. The weather is unusually gloomy and rainy every day, as if taking its cue from his life. After many days of solitude, he finally finds work as a freelance writer for a mysterious occult magazine. Then, one day, Hodaka meets Hina on a busy street corner. This bright and strong-willed girl possesses a strange and wonderful ability: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.","tagline_en":"A story about the secret of this world that only I and she know.","runtime":112,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ماکوتو شینکای"],"crew_en":["Makoto Shinkai"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"醍醐虎汰朗","role":"Hodaka Morishima (voice)","photo":"/i2pNaX2x4naW6Eyf4SGPypqh7To.jpg","en":"Kotaro Daigo"},{"name":"森七菜","role":"Hina Amano (voice)","photo":"/92cSvqzUVbancmqFmtfgdIVBh6s.jpg","en":"Nana Mori"},{"name":"本田翼","role":"Natsumi Suga (voice)","photo":"/1xdR7FXHc3zeRrMyy5qHlDQr9Ou.jpg","en":"Tsubasa Honda"},{"name":"吉柳咲良","role":"Nagisa Amano (voice)","photo":"/jS96RwYZLaPPhlvxKzJmb8ItURN.jpg","en":"Sakura Kiryu"},{"name":"平泉成","role":"Yasui (voice)","photo":"/4zrn7ltgOCvjyk9CWrhmsS7yrlc.jpg","en":"Sei Hiraizumi"},{"name":"倍賞千恵子","role":"Fumi Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/u4mVoOgrqGutrPGi7ZHV1zRAtLK.jpg","en":"Chieko Baisho"},{"name":"小栗旬","role":"Keisuke Suga (voice)","photo":"/4tfrhvqp3IGHPATor0lYE9X9UD3.jpg","en":"Shun Oguri"},{"name"